        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Chichi ndicho chilagane changu nao, Roho wangu ariye ndani yenu, kandakurichani kula vi sambi, hata kare na kare. Na maneno gangu nrigogatiya mwenu kanwani, tagandauka mwenu kanwani, kanwani mwa ana enu, wala kanwani mwa adzukulu enu kula vivi sambi, hata kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
